llama.cpp / GGML
----------------
MFQ's GGUF reader, tokenizer, grammar, chat-template/Jinja implementation, and
CUDA MMA support in `cpp_runtime/text/` are adapted from ggml-org/llama.cpp,
based on commit 25a1d63f4346b472e508c6dbd9ab2ed1d81ace2e, with MFQ-specific
modifications.

